OL,3,GNEWSAGas firm guilty of safety breaches
OL,4,Aafter explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gas company has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fbreaching health and safety law after
OL,8,Fan explosion in a family home in 2024.
OL,10,FIsland Energy was charged for failing
OL,11,Fto ensure the health and safety of
OL,12,Fpeople not in its employment, including
OL,13,Fthe public.
OL,15,FThe five-day trial at Jersey's Royal
OL,16,FCourt followed an investigation by the
OL,17,FHealth and Safety Inspectorate into the
OL,18,Fexplosion at the property on Le Mont
OL,19,FPinel on 26 June 2024.
