OL,5,
OL,6,FThe case concluded in June 2026 but the
OL,7,Fmedia was unable to report any details
OL,8,Funtil the end of a separate trial
OL,9,Fagainst the company for another
OL,10,Fexplosion in 2022 which killed 10
OL,11,Fpeople.
